  "descripcion": "The dragon’s marbles are rolling—only you can stop them! In Zumba – The Dragon’s Marble Trial, shoot, match, and explode marbles before they reach the end. Unleash draconic power-ups, and blaze through mythical worlds. Grab your fire-breath and let the marble-matching magic begin!",
